                <pb facs="0809" n="715" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg715"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Taylor to Mr. Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-05-04"><hi rendition="#italic">May 4,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Telegraphic orders sent Cuba suspending all executive action until examination
                    can be made as to all taken upon <hi rendition="#italic">Competitor</hi> who may
                    prove to be American citizens.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
